(7632841, 1097031, 67145, '<td valign="top">hey Janine .. i''ve been looking at the pics on your profile page .. and i am blown away .. i use that expression a lot .. seems i get blown away a lot .. but only when something is ''worth'' it .. !! .. ;)<br/>you have such a wonderful imagination and your editing is amazing .. <br/>i was looking at your entry in the surreal still life .. and imagined you masking off the cup, saucer, flowers in the vase the strawberry etc .. as to me it looked like an extended edit .. my jaw literally dropped when i looked to see what you scored and saw it was standard .. even reading that you had to balance things etc .. i still have no idea how you did that .. just amazing .. <br/>i like this one a lot .. as with every single image you have on your profile page ... i mean who wouldnt .. <br/>but this made me laugh .. as i have quite a few stephen king novels in my bookcase that i''ve been meaning to read .. i''ve read quite a few .. he''s amazing .. my absolute fav is the green mile .. i read that twice which is very unusual .. then the shawshank redemption .. :)</td>', 'hey Janine .. i''ve been looking at the pics on your profile page .. and i am blown away .. i use that expression a lot .. seems i get blown away a lot .. but only when something is ''worth'' it .. !! .. ;)you have such a wonderful imagination and your editing is amazing .. i was looking at your entry in the surreal still life .. and imagined you masking off the cup, saucer, flowers in the vase the strawberry etc .. as to me it looked like an extended edit .. my jaw literally dropped when i looked to see what you scored and saw it was standard .. even reading that you had to balance things etc .. i still have no idea how you did that .. just amazing .. i like this one a lot .. as with every single image you have on your profile page ... i mean who wouldnt .. but this made me laugh .. as i have quite a few stephen king novels in my bookcase that i''ve been meaning to read .. i''ve read quite a few .. he''s amazing .. my absolute fav is the green mile .. i read that twice which is very unusual .. then the shawshank redemption .. :)', '2019-06-17 05:38:16.000000', NULL, 0);
